WEBVTT

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:06.480
Righty-chan...

00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:08.570
Just wait a second, okay?

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:12.070
I'll get you out of there, so please!

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:14.530
Protect my dad!

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.580
I won't let you get away with

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:23.530
having a kid and running away 
from your fight with me!

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:26.080
Fight... Fight, eh?

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:31.340
I see you've still got nothing on 
your mind but fighting, Shuusaku.

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.260
Shut up! Not only did you abandon our fight,

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.940
but you've just been running 
away to save yourself

00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:40.220
while Bubuki users are hunted down 
and killed, you spineless bastard!

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:53.120
So this gun Bubuki replaces

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:56.160
the right hand of Entei 
that Migiwa burned, then?

00:00:56.970 --> 00:00:58.690
Perhaps you've been relying on

00:00:58.690 --> 00:01:00.850
ranged weapons so much,
you've lost your physical edge.

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:02.910
Enough!

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:22.080
Dad!

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:44.160
<b><i>BUBUKI/BURANKI</i></b>

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:44.160
<b>The Gentle Giants of the Galaxy</b>

00:01:58.590 --> 00:01:59.180
BURANKI

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:02.850
BURANKI

00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:06.640
BURANKI

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:26.540
Kazuki

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:26.540
Kaoruko

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:57.440
<b><i>BUBUKI/BURANKI</i></b>

00:02:56.730 --> 00:02:57.440
<b>The Gentle Giants of the Galaxy</b>

00:02:57.440 --> 00:02:59.030
<b><i>BUBUKI/BURANKI</i></b>

00:02:57.440 --> 00:02:59.030
<b>The Gentle Giants of the Galaxy</b>

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:11.000
You can't win if all you 
do is defend, lady killer!

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:15.470
Hoemaru!

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:27.680
<i>Why...</i>

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:30.870
<i>Why are all my attacks being deflected?</i>

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:33.730
<i>She's not the type to do a lot 
of calculation as she fights.</i>

00:03:34.170 --> 00:03:35.410
<i>I get it!</i>

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:38.230
<i>She's not giving her Bubuki orders!</i>

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:42.450
<i>Her Bubuki is reading my movements 
and telling her what I'll do!</i>

00:04:04.830 --> 00:04:08.810
Fighting like that will only 
cause your Bubuki pain.

00:04:09.860 --> 00:04:12.640
Just like it hurts all of you to be

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:14.140
at the mercy of a heart.

00:04:16.870 --> 00:04:19.230
Are you that scared of that Justin guy?

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:20.570
Mind your own business!

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:24.530
Your fear is being conveyed to your Bubuki!

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:26.070
I am not scared!

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:36.600
The Bubuki acted on its own,

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:39.000
without receiving any orders from Hiiragi?

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:42.120
Iwatooshi here is a real brat.

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:44.470
It doesn't hold back,
even with me, its master!

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:46.970
And that's what I like about it!

00:04:54.590 --> 00:04:56.160
Tell me one thing.

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:58.360
How is it that you all can fight with

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:00.980
such enjoyment and freedom?

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:04.210
We're not enjoying it.

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:05.180
Thing is...

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:08.740
Our heart is a natural-born airhead.

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:12.240
Maybe that's just how he's leading us, too.

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:16.250
Well...

00:05:16.820 --> 00:05:19.880
It looks like we've won here.

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:28.810
It's not the limbs' job to just 
do whatever the heart says.

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:30.390
That's what I believe.

00:05:33.530 --> 00:05:37.920
We won't just do as our heart 
tells us forever, either.

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:41.150
Just watch. I'll change, too, Hiiragi.

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:43.580
R-Right...

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:46.370
I'll look forward to it, Lakshmi.

00:05:55.630 --> 00:06:00.080
Kaoruko, you used up all your Rinzu 
in the last fight, didn't you?

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:03.920
Shut up! Having you worry 
about me makes me wanna puke!

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:07.800
Kaoruko! I'm not done talking to you!

00:06:08.480 --> 00:06:10.590
Don't try to sound like the 
respectable big brother!

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:12.390
Idiot! Idiot! Idiot!

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:13.630
Kaoruko!

00:06:13.630 --> 00:06:14.560
A-chan!

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:16.560
Guys...

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:18.990
You haven't seen her in forever, right?

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:20.580
We should hurry after her!

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:21.560
Yeah.

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:32.260
Damn it, where'd that sister of Azuma's go?

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:36.120
Also, I just realized Azuma 
and Kogane are gone, too.

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:37.290
What?

00:06:37.850 --> 00:06:39.220
They got separated.

00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:42.330
Kogane's poor sense of 
direction is pure genius.

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:44.290
Separated?

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:49.730
So now we have to look for 
the two of them, too?

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:57.390
I swear, that Kaoruko...

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:59.350
She wouldn't even try to listen to me.

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:02.770
A-chan, it'll be okay.

00:07:04.930 --> 00:07:08.810
Kaoruko-chan is no different from back then.

00:07:08.810 --> 00:07:09.900
I'm sure of it.

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:11.970
You think so?

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:13.660
Yeah. I know it!

00:07:14.110 --> 00:07:18.580
I think she just said all those 
things to put up a front.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:21.830
I hope you're right...

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:23.740
Don't worry about a thing!

00:07:25.480 --> 00:07:27.300
Wait a minute...

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:30.960
Where are we?!

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:34.300
San Francisco, America

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:40.310
Buranki Mega-lala

00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:51.580
How are you not awake after 
being drawn on this much?

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:54.040
What kind of creature is Epizo, anyway?

00:07:55.180 --> 00:07:57.830
Hey, Epizo! Wake up already!

00:07:57.830 --> 00:07:59.240
Luis! Hey! Waglula!

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:00.720
Domina!

00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:05.670
What?!

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:28.690
Yeah!

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:31.700
Jeez, Epizo, get your act together.

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:34.670
Sorry, Farrah. But just listen to this.

00:08:34.670 --> 00:08:38.280
My last customer at work 
last night said to me,

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:40.470
"The moon is lovely this evening.

00:08:40.470 --> 00:08:44.130
By the way, where did you buy that T-shirt?"

00:08:44.130 --> 00:08:45.790
So I told him—

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:51.690
Hmm... Now 90% of the déraciné around the

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:54.550
North American continent
have been eliminated.

00:08:54.910 --> 00:08:56.370
All is going well.

00:08:56.370 --> 00:08:57.230
Yes, sir.

00:08:57.750 --> 00:09:02.060
This result, however,
was not expected at all.

00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:03.930
It's the conclusion our engineering

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:06.510
department reached after verification 
through repeated experiments.

00:09:06.510 --> 00:09:08.060
There is no mistake.

00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:11.670
Who would have thought someone besides

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:14.070
Banryuu Reoko could operate Entei?

00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:16.450
In that case,

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:20.410
we must begin practical testing on 
this qualified heart user immediately.

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:21.470
Yes, sir.

00:09:25.430 --> 00:09:30.540
A-chan, I met Kaoruko-chan 
once before, remember?

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:32.640
You did?

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:38.050
I think it was right after you guys 
came down from Treasure Island.

00:09:38.650 --> 00:09:41.260
Oh! We ate shaved ice together!

00:09:41.800 --> 00:09:45.190
Our tongues turned blue! I remember!

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:49.870
Oh... Yeah! It was in summer, right?

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:53.420
The summer of the year I lived 
with Kaoruko and our dad,

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:56.260
right after we fell from Treasure Island.

00:09:56.970 --> 00:10:01.290
And Kaoruko-chan was left here in 
Taiwan not long after that, right?

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:04.410
Dad insisted it was necessary.

00:10:05.440 --> 00:10:09.550
Maybe Kaoruko-chan wants to see your dad.

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:13.870
You traveled with him all 
that time, didn't you?

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:19.020
Kaoruko-chan said she was all 
alone in Taiwan all that time.

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:20.800
Yeah.

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:25.360
I meant to ask you on Treasure Island, 
but I never had the chance.

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:31.270
What is your dad doing right now?

00:10:34.740 --> 00:10:38.280
Dad went up to Treasure Island a year ago,

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:40.700
and he died there.

00:10:42.210 --> 00:10:43.760
He was sick, apparently.

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:51.210
You!

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:58.190
Looks like you hate my guts as much as ever.

00:10:59.570 --> 00:11:04.010
<b>Episode 15
The Right Hand's Scar</b>

00:10:59.570 --> 00:11:04.010
<b><i>BUBUKI/BURANKI
The Gentle Giants
 of the Galaxy</i></b>

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:08.520
<b><i>BUBUKI/BURANKI</i></b>

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:08.520
<b>The Gentle Giants of the Galaxy</b>

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:14.030
What do you think you're playing at?

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:17.030
Please. I need your help.

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:18.530
Like hell!

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:20.400
Why would I help you?!

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:21.590
I'll kill you!

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:22.440
Kogane-chan!

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:23.970
Kogane-chan!

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:25.110
Let me go! Let me go!

00:11:25.110 --> 00:11:28.040
What do you mean, you need our help?

00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:32.000
I want you...

00:11:33.890 --> 00:11:36.540
I want you to save Reoko-sama.

00:11:52.950 --> 00:11:54.170
Reoko?

00:11:54.720 --> 00:11:56.270
Reoko's alive?

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:59.320
Yes. When that island fell,

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:03.350
she was retrieved by Guy along with Entei.

00:12:03.350 --> 00:12:06.280
And now, she's being held captive

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:08.580
at his organization Demokratia's stronghold.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:10.450
So what?!

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:11.790
Kogane-chan!

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:11.790
Out of my way!

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:25.330
Why should we have to save Reoko?!

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:29.940
Why won't you fight me?

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:33.810
If you won't fight me, I'll just kill you!

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:39.230
If you want to kill me, go ahead.

00:12:39.710 --> 00:12:42.890
You have every right to do that.

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:44.660
But...

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:48.300
There's something I need to tell you,

00:12:49.070 --> 00:12:50.090
Kogane.

00:12:51.100 --> 00:12:56.920
Don't you dare speak the name 
that my father gave to me!

00:12:57.540 --> 00:13:01.520
I need to tell you what happened

00:13:01.520 --> 00:13:06.260
when your father, Asabuki Genma, died.

00:13:24.550 --> 00:13:26.240
Genma! Genma!

00:13:32.380 --> 00:13:34.270
You moron!

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:39.000
He had already lost all his 
powers as a Bubuki user!

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:42.370
I couldn't shoot him with a Bubuki gun!

00:13:47.610 --> 00:13:49.170
Dad!

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:57.180
Dad?

00:14:00.260 --> 00:14:04.070
Dad, are you okay?

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:06.200
Dad!

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:12.830
K-Kogane...

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:17.890
Dad...

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:20.030
Dad!

00:14:20.030 --> 00:14:23.950
Dad!

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:34.010
Raijoudou!

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:37.010
He's dead.

00:14:38.430 --> 00:14:42.000
My dad... My dad is...

00:14:54.010 --> 00:14:55.270
The Bubuki's acting on its own!

00:15:04.140 --> 00:15:05.050
This is bad...

00:15:05.970 --> 00:15:09.000
Raijoudou is trying so hard 
to protect her from us,

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:11.890
it's draining too much of her Rinzu.

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:14.580
Her life may actually be in danger.

00:15:23.300 --> 00:15:25.620
Stop, Raijoudou!

00:15:25.620 --> 00:15:29.360
I don't intend to hurt the girl!

00:15:41.490 --> 00:15:42.790
Raijoudou...

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:47.630
To protect this girl, I'm going 
to destroy you right now.

00:15:57.650 --> 00:15:59.050
Stop...

00:15:59.050 --> 00:16:00.770
Stop!

00:16:34.900 --> 00:16:36.640
So what?

00:16:37.190 --> 00:16:41.040
I'm supposed to forgive you because 
it wasn't you who killed him?

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:42.270
No.

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:47.440
If I hadn't been there that day,
Genma wouldn't have died.

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:49.400
I did kill him.

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:56.480
Then why did you chase Kogane-chan 
around all that time?

00:16:57.460 --> 00:17:01.860
Before I lost all my 
powers as a Bubuki user,

00:17:01.860 --> 00:17:05.390
I wanted to destroy Raijoudou.

00:17:06.470 --> 00:17:10.770
Having a monster like a Bubuki 
clinging to you from birth...

00:17:11.390 --> 00:17:14.300
For a child, that's like a curse.

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:18.470
So if I could destroy Raijoudou,

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:21.840
she should be able to live a better life.

00:17:22.300 --> 00:17:24.310
That's what I always thought.

00:17:25.220 --> 00:17:29.520
But you're the one who ruined everything.

00:17:30.490 --> 00:17:33.470
I'm not asking you to forgive me.

00:17:33.470 --> 00:17:36.960
But from now on, Kogane,

00:17:36.960 --> 00:17:40.180
I've decided that I'll live to protect you.

00:17:40.180 --> 00:17:42.330
It's the least I can do to atone.

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:44.160
Atone?!

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:48.120
Then atone with your death!

00:17:48.120 --> 00:17:49.950
I'll kill you right now!

00:17:49.950 --> 00:17:50.880
Kogane-chan!

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:54.320
Matobai, isn't the reason you won't fight

00:17:54.320 --> 00:17:57.430
because you've already lost all your powers?

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:01.970
Migiwa is special.

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:06.390
When we Bubuki users have children...
become parents...

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:10.500
we lose all of our powers.

00:18:11.530 --> 00:18:14.570
And I just had a kid, too.

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:17.420
So what?!

00:18:17.420 --> 00:18:19.500
So I'm supposed to forgive you now?!

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:21.620
I'm supposed to not kill you now?!

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:23.580
You coward!

00:18:24.130 --> 00:18:26.840
I don't care if you kill me.

00:18:26.840 --> 00:18:32.090
But I'm begging you, please save Reoko-sama.

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:36.720
Stop being so self-serving!

00:18:41.710 --> 00:18:42.740
Kogane-chan...

00:18:43.900 --> 00:18:48.050
A-chan, what am I supposed to do?

00:18:48.050 --> 00:18:50.800
He killed my dad!

00:18:50.800 --> 00:18:55.450
All my life, I've wanted to kill him.

00:18:55.870 --> 00:18:59.270
But I... I...

00:18:59.860 --> 00:19:03.740
I can't kill him. I can't do it.

00:19:06.220 --> 00:19:10.280
But I won't see my dad again.

00:19:11.560 --> 00:19:14.100
There's no way I can ever see him again.

00:19:16.510 --> 00:19:18.370
That's just not right.

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:21.270
It's too much.

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:05.930
I've decided.

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:10.250
I won't talk about killing you anymore.

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:13.980
But I won't forgive you, either.

00:20:15.320 --> 00:20:16.510
Okay.

00:20:36.530 --> 00:20:38.840
It's just as we predicted.

00:20:39.570 --> 00:20:44.390
The Buranki nest remains in nearly the 
exact same shape it had before its fall.

00:20:45.340 --> 00:20:47.680
What's the matter, Kaoruko?

00:20:48.170 --> 00:20:49.720
Nothing.

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:52.850
Are you worried about Oubu,
now that it's been stolen from you?

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:54.480
That was...

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:57.320
When your limbs are just a 
bunch of ordinary people,

00:20:57.320 --> 00:20:59.360
you can't take anything.

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:02.250
There's no need to worry, Kaoruko.

00:21:02.250 --> 00:21:04.610
You did the best you could.

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:06.030
Above all,

00:21:06.030 --> 00:21:11.340
you proved that you are a heart 
user worthy of controlling a Buranki.

00:21:14.880 --> 00:21:16.860
Really? Really? Really?!

00:21:16.860 --> 00:21:18.920
Yes, of course.

00:21:20.420 --> 00:21:23.950
Kaoruko, there's something 
I'd like to show you.

00:21:30.130 --> 00:21:31.650
Is this...

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:35.890
It's Entei, which we were fortunate 
enough to successfully recover.

00:21:35.890 --> 00:21:39.190
We've added legs to give 
it its complete form.

00:21:39.190 --> 00:21:43.570
It's a present from me to you, Kaoruko.

00:21:44.470 --> 00:21:48.320
Guy-sama! I'm so happy!

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:53.040
Kaoruko, you are the one 
best suited to pilot Entei.

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:55.830
Yeah! I think I am, too!

00:21:56.830 --> 00:21:59.340
It's very red... I like that!

00:21:59.340 --> 00:22:00.840
The red of passion!

00:22:00.840 --> 00:22:02.340
The red of boiling blood!

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:05.340
The red of flames razing 
everything to the ground!

00:22:06.110 --> 00:22:10.010
Now I'll use this to pulverize Azuma's Oubu!
